# Munthal-Republik
github repository for munthal

Münthal Republik is a country in Western Europe that controls the real-world German state of Bavaria.

# Government
Münthal's government is a republic. The government revolves around the people, which is probably a large factor of why they spend most tax dollars on the people, instead of their military.

# Military
Their army isn't very developed, as they remain mostly neutral. They still have some modern equipment, mostly vehicles.

Münthal Republik's National Army uses equipment from the 80s, 90s, and early 2000s. Their main weapon is the G3A3, which used to be used by the German Army. They have more modern vehicles, especially when compared to the rest of the Army's equipment.

Münthal Republik's National Air Force uses airplanes from the 1950s all the way up to the modern day. Their personal equipment is also less advanced than their vehicles, as pilots use uniforms and gear from the 1970s and 80s. However, their helmets are up to date.

# Economy
Münthal Republik's economy relies heavily on trade with fellow nations, employees, and a balanced market. Without workers, Münthal can't make money efficiently. That is why a rather large portion of the country's money is put into paying the employees, and creating programs that benefit the employees and employers. 

# Healthcare
Unlike the United States, Münthal provides free healthcare for its citizens. Taxes paid by the people fund the country's healthcare. 

# Diplomacy
Münthal Republik remains mostly neutral, staying out of other nations' business while still maintaining trade. They are surrounded by larger, more powerful neighbors, like Norland. Their small size and outdated equipment make them an easy target for strong armies. Their government is considering who they could ally with in the event they need help against a foreign invader.
